s.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What details are mentioned in the RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Exam Date Notice?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: The notice generally includes the exam date, examination schedule, reporting time, exam shift, and important instructions for candidates.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-end=\"105\" data-start=\"26\">Question: Is it mandatory to carry the admit card to the examination centre?</strong><strong><br/>\n</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. Candidates must carry a printed copy of the admit card along with a valid original photo ID proof to the examination centre.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>RPSC</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>RPSC</strong> is <strong>https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/home</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Exam Date 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-37741 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-02T162712.444-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-02T162712.444-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-02T162712.444-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sark